/* ---------------- overseas（保留 4 个标杆 + data-fp 按钮；修 undefined；换新鲜 extra） ---------------- */
function obench(name, fpTitle, sketch, biz, play, found, turn, look, site){
  return `<div class="co"><div class="co-h"><b>${name}</b><span class="co-t hd">头部</span></div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>速写：</b>${sketch}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>主营业务：</b>${biz}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>市场与打法：</b>${play}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r found"><b>📜 发家史：</b>${found}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r turn"><b>🔑 转折点：</b>${turn}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r look"><b>💡 看点：</b>${look} <button class="fam-btn" data-fp="${fpTitle}">📖 名人故事</button></div>`
    + `<div class="co-r">官网：<a class="co-site" href="${site}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🌐 ${site}</a></div></div>`;
}
function oco(name, sketch, buyer, biz, found, look, site){
  const s = site?`<div class="co-r">官网：<a class="co-site" href="${site}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🌐 ${site}</a></div>`:``;
  return `<div class="co"><div class="co-h"><b>${name}</b><span class="co-t sm">中小</span></div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>速写：</b>${sketch}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>采购画像：</b>${buyer}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r"><b>主营业务：</b>${biz}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r found"><b>📜 发家史：</b>${found}</div>`
    + `<div class="co-r look"><b>💡 看点：</b>${look}</div>`
    + s + `</div>`;
}
